  "prefLabel": "Liq 702.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Liq 702.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to maintain a uniform and systematic approach to licensing of businesses as required and described under Liq 700 and RSA 178.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Liq 700) #13114, eff 9-25-20; (see also Revision Note at part heading for Liq 702)",
